  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ACCRA II - Africa Climate Change</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the Africa Climate Change Resilience Alliance (ACCRA II) is to ensure that vulnerable people are more resilient to the effects of climate change. The ACCRA II programme will seek to use the experience from programmes on climate change adaptation  disaster risk reduction  social protection and sustainable livelihoods experience in three countries; Mozambique  Uganda and Ethiopia  to influence national governments  regional bodies and international institutions to achieve our goal.</narrative>
  </description>
